---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import site from '../content/site.json';
const b = site.business;
---
<Site title="Privacy">
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap stack" style="max-width:720px">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>{b.name} collects the details you send through our quote form (name, phone, email, suburb and job details) so we can reply and quote on your job.</p>
    <p>We count visits to this website to see which pages help people and how they found us (for example a Google search or one of our ads). This uses no cookies and stores nothing that identifies you: no name, no email and no IP address. If your browser asks sites not to track you, we don't count your visit.</p>
    <p>We keep them in our customer system, don't sell them, and only share them with people who help us do the job. You can ask us to see, correct or delete your details at any time{b.email ? <> by emailing <a href={`mailto:${b.email}`}>{b.email}</a></> : ''}.</p>
    <p class="muted">This is a plain starter notice. Have it checked for your business before you rely on it.</p>
  </div></section>
</Site>
